{"id":"5fa79c8e3fa53370","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-translation.md","title":"Syntax Translation","display":"df-translation — Syntax Translation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-translation","aliases":["57-df-translation"],"display":"df-translation — Syntax Translation","depends_on":["[[57-df-first-order-language]]","[[57-df-formula]]","[[57-df-sentence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-translation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-translation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-translation — Syntax Translation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"140b30594fbd26d8\" href=\"?note=140b30594fbd26d8\" title=\"57-df-first-order-language\">57-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"38cb16fd577caf7b\" href=\"?note=38cb16fd577caf7b\" title=\"57-df-sentence\">57-df-sentence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_1,S_2\">\\(S_1,S_2\\)</span> 为一阶字母表。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_1}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_2}\">\\(\\tau:\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_1}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_2}\\)</span> 为给定函数参数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_1}\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>。下式定义本文件原来要求的三个交换条件，不额外要求原子替换、量词相对化或其他联结词交换。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Translation}(\\tau,S_1,S_2)\">\\(\\mathrm{Translation}(\\tau,S_1,S_2)\\)</span> 是下式定义的三元语法翻译谓词，参数依次为候选公式映射、源字母表和靶字母表。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Translation}(\\tau,S_1,S_2)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\tau:\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_1}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_2}\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;[\\\\\n&amp;\\tau(\\neg\\varphi)=\\neg\\tau(\\varphi)\\land\\tau(\\varphi\\land\\psi)=(\\tau(\\varphi)\\land\\tau(\\psi))\\land\\tau(\\exists x\\varphi)=\\exists x\\tau(\\varphi)].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Translation}(\\tau,S_1,S_2)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\tau:\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_1}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_2}\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;[\\\\\n&amp;\\tau(\\neg\\varphi)=\\neg\\tau(\\varphi)\\land\\tau(\\varphi\\land\\psi)=(\\tau(\\varphi)\\land\\tau(\\psi))\\land\\tau(\\exists x\\varphi)=\\exists x\\tau(\\varphi)].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原式混用了对象语言的合取与元层等式间合取，并未绑定公式与变量。τ 是参数，不由这三个条件唯一产生。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"140b30594fbd26d8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"38cb16fd577caf7b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-sentence]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S_1,S_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau:\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_1}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_1}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Translation}(\\tau,S_1,S_2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Translation}(\\tau,S_1,S_2)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\tau:\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_1}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_2}\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;[\\\\\n&\\tau(\\neg\\varphi)=\\neg\\tau(\\varphi)\\land\\tau(\\varphi\\land\\psi)=(\\tau(\\varphi)\\land\\tau(\\psi))\\land\\tau(\\exists x\\varphi)=\\exists x\\tau(\\varphi)].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1302,"backlinks":[{"id":"5c06742bc27c04ba","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_1,S_2$ 为一阶字母表。固定 $\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_2}$、$\\mathrm{FV}(\\delta)\\subseteq\\{x\\}$，以及公式族 $(\\varphi_R)_{R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{S_1}}$、$(\\varphi_f)_{f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{S_1}}$、$(\\varphi_c)_{c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_{S_1}}$，其值均在 $\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_2}$。这些族连同 $\\delta$ 构成原四元组 $\\mathcal I$。$\\mathrm{Translation}$ 取 [[57-df-translation]]。环境另给定一个函数 $e\\in\\mathcal E_{S_1,S_2}$；同一环境对每个被使用的 $\\mathcal I$ 固定这一选择，$\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathcal I}$ 为其原调用名。没有给出 $e$ 时不允许仅凭四元组计算 Eval。"},{"id":"14f0accd0b75a0b1","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_1,S_2$ 为有效一阶语言，$T_i\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_i}$、$\\mathrm{EffGN}(g_i,S_i)$（$i=1,2$）。两侧证明关系固定为 [[57-df-hilbert-derivable]] 的 $\\vdash_H$；$\\mathrm{Undec}(T_i)$ 分别在 [[57-df-decidable-theory]] 的 $(S_i,g_i,H)$ 环境取值。$\\mathrm{Translation}(e,S_1,S_2)$ 取 [[57-df-translation]]；$\\mathrm{Rec}$ 的函数、数集重载取既有定义。$\\mathrm{SynInterp}$ 以下式给出足以转移不可判定性的有效、保守翻译条件；若用四元组 $\\mathcal I$ 记其实现，$e=\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathcal I}$ 必须满足这些条件。"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-203","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-